ATTRIBUTION
===========

The database built by this repository contains data from the sources below.
Anyone who publishes the database, a part of it, or something produced from
it must reproduce these credits. The same texts are in sources.toml, in
dist/manifest.json and in the table `sources` of dist/food.sqlite.

A short form for an application's "About" screen:

    Food data: Open Food Facts (ODbL), USDA FoodData Central, Ciqual (Anses),
    Swiss Food Composition Database (FSVO), Canadian Nutrient File (Health
    Canada), CoFID (UK). Database made available under the Open Database
    License.

with links to https://openfoodfacts.org and to the licence,
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Open Food Facts also asks
that a record of a product links to its page, which is the `source_url` of
the record.

